    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used AI tools like chatbots and calculators to review algebra and calculus concepts. I found them helpful for quick explanations and step-by-step solutions. They didn’t replace my understanding, but they helped me visualize problems and check my work. I appreciated their speed and clarity, though I still needed to verify results with traditional methods.",
